A||||43||Eric_PA||Will a QUAD in my Fiero make it a "RICER"||||1||
Z||000000||Eric_PA||10-03-2000||12:57 PM||||I was just wondering since I have been hearing a lot about "RICERS" on here lately. Will my Fiero bcome known as a Ricer when I finish a Quad 4 swap into it? The only outer mods would possibly be a custom license plate and maybe a DOHC sticker. What do you guys think?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Raydar||10-03-2000||01:13 PM||||Eric,<P>Not even close to ricer status.<BR>This swap comes up at least once a month as a forum topic.<BR>At least one of the folks on this forum has already done it. <BR>Gave him no end of frustration. Mostly electrical stuff. I don't recall exactly what the deal was, but he did figure it out. <P>The things that get people in a "rice-calling" frame of mind are things like "coffee can" exhaust tips, wheels that poke out five inches from the wheelwells, and such. Or stuff that is a blatant lie, such as "Type R" stickers, etc. <P>If you put a DOHC sticker on a car with a Quad 4, you'll be losing the element of surprise, but it <I>sure</I> isn't ricey. <P>Keep in mind that tastes vary. If everybody liked exactly the same things, it would be a very boring world. So, do whatever you want to do. If somebody doesn't like it, they'll probably voice an opinion. But it's just that. An opinion. Have fun.<P>Welcome to the Forum! This is probably the largest collection of Fiero knowledge in the world. (Has saved my butt on a number of occasions.) And is also a hell of a lot of fun.<P>Cliff, our gracious host and moderator, does a wonderful job of keeping it all running.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (soon to receive transplant.)<BR>88 "pretzeled" Formula <P>Out of my mind.<BR>Back in five minutes.<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 10-03-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000002||count_iblis||10-03-2000||01:18 PM||||riceboy?  No its still will be all AMERICAN!Riceboys in my def are the little guys out there now and days with the little ol civics with stickers on there cars to make them go faster.  I remember seeing one ricer and he pointed out his type r sticker to me and he said in all seriousness do you know what that means?  I said no what?  I said an extra 30 hp!  I just waited for him to say just kidding but he was serious so i asked him what all mods and stuff he had done to it and he said just an ait intake on the orig. motor.  Just an air intake huh?  I want some of what he is smoking you know what im saying? I have nothing against some of the auth. riceboys most of the cars can stand up to what they are shouting, its just the wannabe one minute uncle ben's out there!<P><BR>Count<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||count_iblis||10-03-2000||01:22 PM||||in the post i said "I said an extra 30 hp"  that was suppose to read "he said an extra 30 hp"  sorry about that guys and gals.  Btw Please ignore my spelling.  I cant spell today ||||reg||1
