Z||000007||Pontiaddict||10-03-2000||07:42 PM||||Yes, it will.<P>Not that I mean it, I just figured someone would say it. And why can't that be me?<P>I don't like Q-4s because of a personal choice. The later DOHC motors are okay though. Your thoughts may differ. It's your car, do what you want.<P>What if you swapped in a Northstar and put DOHC stickers on your car? ||||reg||1
